@startuml
title UML State Chart Diagram - Healthcare Portal

[*] --> Start

state Start <<choice>>
Start --> Register : [Register]
Start --> SignIn : [SignIn]

state "Registration" as Register
Register : entry / start registration process
Register : do / fill in user details and submit
Register : exit / [reg success] | [reg failure]

state "Registration Failed" as RegistrationFailed
RegistrationFailed : entry / handle failed registration
RegistrationFailed --> Start

state "SignIn" as SignIn
SignIn : entry / enter credentials
SignIn : do / validate user
SignIn : exit / [sign in success] | [sign in failure]

state "Home" as Home
Home : entry / user successfully signed in
Home : do / display available facilities and options
Home --> NewsContent : [view news/expert content]
Home --> HealthInfo : [access health information]
Home --> SymptomCheck : [check symptoms]
Home --> FitnessOptions : [use fitness options]
Home --> InsuranceValidation : [access financial services]

state "News/Expert Content" as NewsContent
NewsContent : entry / view news or expert content
NewsContent : do / read and interact with content
NewsContent --> Home

state "
@enduml
